重婚，西戎皆服，所以為王。王其圖之。」於是孝王曰：「昔伯翳為舜主畜，畜多息，故有土，賜姓嬴。今其後世亦為朕息馬，朕其分土為附庸。」邑之秦，使復續嬴氏祀，號曰秦嬴。亦不廢申侯之女子為駱適者，以和西戎。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m004-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"非子","kind":"person","person_id":"1zm_8zk_4hh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m004-0021","start":21,"end":24,"surface":"周孝王","kind":"person","person_id":"3s4_d8d_8v7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m004-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"孝王","kind":"person","person_id":"3s4_d8d_8v7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m004-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"孝王","kind":"person","person_id":"3s4_d8d_8v7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m004-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"大駱","kind":"person","person_id":"fto_fi5_11x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m004-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"申侯","kind":"person","person_id":"3gd_w8i_skr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m004-0055","start":55,"end":56,"surface":"女","kind":"person","person_id":"1lp_mgy_t05","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m004-0057","start":57,"end":59,"surface":"大駱","kind":"person","person_id":"fto_fi5_11x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m004-0063","start":63,"end":64,"surface":"成","kind":"person","person_id":"9mh_7cb_704","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m004-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"申侯","kind":"person","person_id":"3gd_w8i_skr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m004-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"孝王","kind":"person","person_id":"3s4_d8d_8v7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m004-0079","start":79,"end":83,"surface":"酈山之女","kind":"person","person_id":"xj8_5eq_dtl","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m004-0085","start":85,"end":88,"surface":"戎胥軒","kind":"person","p